{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52605","headline":"示志诚偈二首 二 · 慧能","name":"示志诚偈二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"心地无非（《灯录》作「一切无心」）自性戒，心地（《灯录》作「一切」）无痴自性慧。\n心地无乱自性定（《灯录》无此句），不增不减（《灯录》作「退」）自金刚，身去身来本三昧。\n（见契嵩本《六祖大师法宝坛经》、《景德传灯录》卷五）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52605.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52605","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}